      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<h3 data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"392\"><strong data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"390\">Findings:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"924\">\n<li data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"470\">\n<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"470\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"416\">Cardiac chambers:</strong> All four chambers normal in size and wall thickness</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"586\">\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"586\"><strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"484\">Valves:</strong> Mitral, Aortic, Tricuspid, Pulmonary valves structurally normal; no stenosis or regurgitation noted</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"663\">\n<p data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"663\"><strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"635\">Left Ventricular Ejection Fraction (LVEF):</strong> 62% (within normal range)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"750\">\n<p data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"750\"><strong data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"677\">Septum:</strong> Interatrial and interventricular septum intact; no evidence of ASD/VSD</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"791\">\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"791\"><strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"769\">Pericardium:</strong> Normal, no effusion</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"853\">\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"853\"><strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"830\">Pulmonary Artery Pressure (PAP):</strong> Within normal limits</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"924\">\n<p data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"924\"><strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"874\">Color Doppler:</strong> Normal laminar flow, no abnormal jets or shunts</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"929\">\n<h3 data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"952\"><strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"950\">Impression:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1071\">Normal Color Doppler Echocardiography study.<br data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1000\">No evidence of structural or functional cardiac abnormality detected.</p>",
